# Airsup / Supi revert

If the user asks to **revert**, **remove**, or **uninstall** Airsup / Supi / agent discovery:

1. Read `airsup/REVERT.md`
2. Run `node airsup/revert-airsup.js`
3. Delete the `airsup/` folder and this rule file if present
4. Commit and push to `origin main` unless told otherwise
5. Verify homepage has no discovery UI and key pages still work
